SwapperV1::constructor
├── when passing valid tokens
│   ├── it deploys
│   ├── it sets the deposited token
│   └── it sets the swapped token
└── when passing same token for deposited and swapped
    └── it reverts

SwapperV1::deposit
├── when passing valid native token amount
│   ├── it deposits the amount to the contract
│   ├── it updates the deposit token amount
│   ├── it sets the hasWithdrawn flag to false
│   ├── it updates the balance of the contract
│   └── it emits TokensDeposited
├── when passing valid erc20 token amount
│   ├── it deposits the amount to the contract
│   ├── it updates the deposit token amount
│   ├── it sets the hasWithdrawn flag to false
│   ├── it updates the balance of the contract
│   └── it emits TokensDeposited
├── when depositing more than once
│   ├── it deposits the amount to the contract
│   ├── it updates the deposit token amount
│   ├── it does not change the hasWithdrawn flag
│   ├── it updates the balance of the contract
│   └── it emits TokensDeposited
├── when passing amount of 0
│   └── it reverts
├── when balance of the contract is less than the amount sent
│   └── it reverts
├── when balance of the contract is greater than the amount sent
│   └── it reverts
└── when called after swap
    └── it reverts

SwapperV1::swap
├── when swapping native to ERC20 tokens to the contract
│   ├── it transfers the native token to the contract
│   ├── it transfers the ERC20 tokens to the owner
│   ├── it sets the swapped flag to true
│   └── it emits TokensSwapped
├── when swapping ERC20 to native token to the contract
│   ├── it transfers the ERC20 tokens to the contract
│   ├── it transfers the native token to the owner
│   ├── it sets the swapped flag to true
│   └── it emits TokensSwapped
├── when transferring insufficient tokens to the contract
│   └── it reverts
├── when passing amount of 0
│   └── it reverts
├── when called after swap
│   └── it reverts
└── when called by a non-owner
    └── it reverts

SwapperV1::withdraw
├── when withdrawing native token
│   ├── it transfers the tokens to the user
│   ├── it updates the hasWithdrawn flag
│   └── it emits SwappedTokensWithdrawn
├── when withdrawing ERC20 token
│   ├── it transfers the tokens to the user
│   ├── it updates the hasWithdrawn flag
│   └── it emits SwappedTokensWithdrawn
├── when no tokens to withdraw
│   └── it reverts
├── when already withdrawn
│   └── it reverts
└── when called before swap
    └── it reverts

SwapperV1::withdrawDeposit
├── when withdrawing
│   ├── it returns the deposit token amount to the user
│   ├── it deletes the swap info
│   └── it emits DepositWithdrawn
├── when no tokens to withdraw
│   └── it reverts
└── when called after swap
    └── it reverts


SwapperV1::emergencyWithdraw
├── when withdrawing
│   ├── it transfers the tokens to the user
│   └── it emits EmergencyWithdraw
├── when passing amount of 0
│   └── it reverts
├── when called by a non-owner
│   └── it reverts
└── when passing amount greater than the balance
    └── it reverts